preConditionHook:
// Target at the signal bar's open (Brian's phone notes P14-b, p. 40): the open
// of the bar W + 1 before the fill bar (P14's bear bar), frozen on the fill bar
// where BarsSinceEntry() == 0 (VERIFIED: 0 on the fill bar and while flat).
// Read every bar, freeze conditionally -- EntryBarExtremeTarget's form. W must
// equal the entry's W. Not EntryBarExtremeTarget (signal bar's far extreme at [1]).
prevOpen = open[(int)W + 1];
if (el_eq((double)ctx.BarsSinceEntry(), 0.0)) {
    sigOpen = prevOpen;
}
